---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = "Miami-Dade Mortgage Broker Areas | 34 Local Mortgage Pages";
const description = "";
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
<main id="main"><section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Miami-Dade mortgage service area hub</p><h1>Mortgage Broker Pages for Miami-Dade County</h1><p>Explore local mortgage pages for all 34 incorporated Miami-Dade municipalities, with internal links to FHA, condo, jumbo, VA, bank statement, DSCR, refinance, and preapproval resources.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="start.html">Start Mortgage Review</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="get-preapproved-miami.html">Get Preapproved</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="mortgage-calculator-florida.html">Calculate Payment</a></div><div class="trust-row"><span class="trust-pill">34 municipality pages</span><span class="trust-pill">Miami-Dade focused</span><span class="trust-pill">NMLS #2560919</span></div></div><form class="lead-form"><h2>Request a Miami-Dade Mortgage Review</h2><p>Answer a few basics and review the best mortgage path for your Miami-Dade scenario.</p><label>Loan goal<select><option>Select one</option><option>Buying a home</option><option>Refinancing</option><option>Condo financing</option><option>Investment property</option></select></label><div class="form-row"><label>Purchase price / value<input placeholder="$650,000"></label><label>Down payment / equity<input placeholder="$100,000"></label></div><div class="form-row"><label>Credit score range<select><option>Select range</option><option>760+</option><option>720–759</option><option>680–719</option><option>640–679</option></select></label><label>Property city<input placeholder="Miami"></label></div><div class="form-row"><label>Name<input></label><label>Phone<input></label></div><label>Email<input type="email"></label><button class="btn btn-primary full" type="button">Start Mortgage Review</button></form></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container two-col"><article class="prose"><p class="eyebrow">Local coverage</p><h2>Why every Miami-Dade municipality needs its own mortgage page</h2><p>Miami-Dade is not one mortgage market. A Brickell high-rise condo, a Pinecrest single-family home, a Hialeah first-time buyer purchase, a Homestead VA buyer, a Key Biscayne second home, and a Sunny Isles Beach luxury condo can all require different documentation, payment planning, property review, and loan-program strategy.</p><p>These local pages make it easy to find mortgage guidance specific to where you're buying or refinancing across Miami-Dade.</p><div class="hub-note">We provide mortgage guidance across all 34 official Miami-Dade municipalities, plus priority neighborhoods.</div></article><aside class="content-card"><h2>Next expansion clusters</h2><ul><li><a href="condo-loans-miami.html">Condo loans</a> for coastal/high-rise markets</li><li><a href="jumbo-loans-miami.html">Jumbo loans</a> for luxury areas</li><li><a href="fha-loan-miami.html">FHA loans</a> for affordability-focused cities</li><li><a href="bank-statement-loans-miami.html">Bank statement loans</a> for business owners</li><li><a href="dscr-loans-miami.html">DSCR loans</a> for investors</li></ul></aside></div><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">All 34 official municipalities</p><h2>Miami-Dade municipality pages</h2><div class="card-grid small-grid"><a class="mini-card" href="mortgage-broker-aventura.html">Aventura<span>→</span></a><a class="mini-card" href="mortgage-broker-bal-harbour.html">Bal Harbour<span>→</span></a><a class="mini-card" href="mortgage-broker-bay-harbor-islands.html">Bay Harbor Islands<span>→</span></a><a class="mini-card" href="mortgage-broker-biscayne-park.html">Biscayne Park<span>→</span></a><a class="mini-card" href="mortgage-broker-coral-gables.html">Coral Gables<span>→</span></a><a class="mini-card" href="mortgage-broker-cutler-bay.html">Cutler Bay<span>→</span></a><a class="mini-card" href="mortgage-broker-doral.html">Doral<span>→</span></a><a class="mini-card" href="mortgage-broker-el-portal.html">El Portal<span>→</span></a><a 